<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-McDonald's cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-McDonald's cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex Brown &amp; Sons said it cut McDonald's Corp to neutral from buy on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- McDonald's shares fell 1/4 to 44-1/2 in early trading.</p>
</text>
